# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 16. Knowledge Graph & Multi-Agent Architecture (Graphify for GitHub Agents)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# We deliberately TRACK the core Graphify deliverables on GitHub so any AI agent
# (Claude, Cursor, Windsurf, Codex, Antigravity, Copilot, etc.) inspecting this
# repository can immediately parse the codebase topology, god nodes, and communities:
#   - graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md (Comprehensive architectural dossier)
#   - graphify-out/graph.html       (Interactive visual knowledge graph)
#   - graphify-out/graph.json       (Full AST relational graph & dependency edges)
#   - graphify-out/manifest.json    (Indexed entity metadata & community clusters)
#   - graphify-out/wiki/**          (Structured codebase documentation)

# Filter out internal graphify churn, intermediate caches, daily backups & runners:
graphify-cache/
graphify-backups/
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
graphify-out/.*
graphify-out/*.py
graphify-out/cost.json
/.graphify_*
.graphify_*

# Whitelist Graphify Core Deliverables & Agent Skill Package
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/graph.html
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/manifest.json
!graphify-out/wiki/
!graphify-out/wiki/**
!graph.html
!GRAPH_REPORT.md
!.agents/skills/graphify/**

